# MINI AHRS board (ESP32-S31)
# u-blox on connector S1 at 460800: with GPS_AUTO_CONFIG 1 the driver only
# accepts it at 230400, so the module must already send UBX on its own
SERIAL3_PROTOCOL 5
SERIAL3_BAUD 460
GPS_AUTO_CONFIG 0
# EKF3: random walk of the SCH16T-K10 offsets, from the datasheet drift
# (README.md, "Rumori EKF3"); the white noise and compass terms keep the
# EKF3 defaults
EK3_GBIAS_P_NSE 0.0001
EK3_ABIAS_P_NSE 0.0008
